DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART:20260103T090000
DTEND:20260103T100000
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:DEADLINE: KAUST MS\, MS/PhD & PhD with KAUST Fellowship (Fall 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Minimum stage: Graduate (Bachelor's completed\, or Master's/PhD
  student)\nEligibility: Fall 2027 is open to MS\, MS/PhD and PhD applicant
 s (Spring admission is PhD only). Admitted students are automatically cons
 idered for the KAUST Fellowship\, and there is no separate fellowship appl
 ication.\nBenefits: Reported to cover tuition\, housing and a stipend (abo
 ut US$20\,000 a year for MS and US$25\,000-30\,000 for PhD). Confirm on th
 e KAUST admissions site.\nDeadline: Jan 3\, 2027 for Fall 2027. Applicatio
 ns opened Sept 28\, 2026\, decisions are scheduled for Feb 25\, 2027 and t
 he semester starts Aug 29\, 2027. Some sites mention earlier priority date
 s\, which the official timeline does not show.\nPortal: https://admissions
 .kaust.edu.sa/how-to-apply/admission-timelines
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-P14D
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Reminder: DEADLINE: KAUST MS\, MS/PhD & PhD with KAUST Fellowsh
 ip (Fall 2027) in 14 days
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-P3D
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Urgent: DEADLINE: KAUST MS\, MS/PhD & PhD with KAUST Fellowship
  (Fall 2027) in 3 days
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
