SUMMARY:DEADLINE: MBZUAI Master's & PhD in AI (Fall 2027 intake)
DESCRIPTION:Minimum stage: Graduate (Bachelor's completed\, or Master's/PhD
  student)\nFocus: Master's and PhD programmes in AI-related fields (machin
 e learning\, computer vision\, NLP\, robotics and more) at MBZUAI in Abu D
 habi.\nBenefits: PhD students are funded. Master's funding is not automati
 c: regular M.Sc. students are fee-paying by default unless funded\, and th
 e Master in Applied AI is fee-based with no funding. Stipends for funded i
 nternational students have been reported at AED 15\,500 (M.Sc.) and AED 17
 \,500 (PhD) a month\, so confirm on the fees and scholarships page.\nDeadl
 ine: Most programmes close Dec 15\, 2026 at 5 p.m. GST\, with decisions by
  Mar 31\, 2027. Exceptions: Computational Biology closes Jan 22\, 2027 and
  the Master in Applied AI closes Feb 28\, 2027.\nRequirements: Application
  fee of AED 200. Check each programme page for documents and test requirem
 ents.\nPortal: https://mbzuai.ac.ae/study/graduate-admission-process/
