SUMMARY:DEADLINE: ETH Zurich Student Summer Research Fellowship (SSRF)
DESCRIPTION:Minimum stage: Undergraduate\nFocus: Research areas listed by E
 TH: Machine Learning\, Information Security\, Computer Systems\, Robotics\
 , Programming Languages and Software Engineering\, Bio/Medical informatics
 \, Human-computer interaction\, Theory and Visual Computing.\nEligibility:
  Undergraduate and graduate students worldwide\, except students enrolled 
 at ETH Zurich. The programme is aimed at students gaining their first rese
 arch experience. Earlier calls also asked for an expected graduation date 
 in the year after the fellowship or later\, and availability for both summ
 er months.\nBenefits: Two summer months at ETH. The stipend is reported to
  cover travel\, accommodation and living costs\, so confirm on the call pa
 ge.\nRequirements: Academic transcript\, CV and motivation letter\, as lis
 ted in earlier calls.\nDeadline: Applications reportedly run Nov 1 to Dec 
 16\, 2026 (the 2024 cutoff was 13:00 CET). ETH's page had not been updated
  for the 2027 call when I checked\, so confirm the date and time.\nPortal:
  https://inf.ethz.ch/studies/summer-research-fellowship.html
